    "applicationMode": "Scholarship/Top Class component: Online through the National Scholarship Portal (NSP) after admission to a Ministry-notified institution. Fellowship component: Online through the Ministry of Tribal Affairs’ designated fellowship portal when a current official call is announced. The historic guideline refers to the Ministry fellowship portal. Verify the active 2026-27 portal and notice before publishing a direct fellowship link.",
