    "applicationWindow": "Check NSP / State Portal for current cycle. The official guidelines suggest state portals open from 1st April for Freeship Card generation and fresh registrations, with state application cycles running through September/November annually https://www.myscheme.gov.in/schemes/pm-yasasvipmsobcebcdnts&rut=b4d341259191d6172f7d88dee16bef47a76859d4b36214800832f55797cc781a",
