    "benefits": "Disbursed directly into the student's Aadhaar-seeded bank account via Direct Benefit Transfer (DBT): - Graduation Level (1st, 2nd, and 3rd Year of regular degree / technical courses): ₹12,000 per annum per student. - Post-Graduation Level (1st and 2nd Year of Master's degree): ₹20,000 per annum per student. - 5-Year Integrated / Professional Degree Courses (e.g., Integrated M.Sc., MBBS, 5-year Law): ₹12,000/year for the first 3 years, and ₹20,000 per annum in the 4th and 5th years. - 4-Year Technical Degree Courses (e.g., B.Tech / B.E.): ₹12,000/year for the 1st, 2nd, and 3rd years, and ₹20,000 in the 4th year (scholarship stops at graduation). (Maximum total tenure: 5 years of higher education).",
