      "Aadhaar card/Aadhaar number for OTR, biometric authentication and DBT.",
      "Parent/guardian income certificate issued by the competent authority, confirming annual income of ₹2.5 lakh or less.",
      "Proof of age, such as a birth certificate or Class 10 certificate/marksheet.",
      "Previous academic qualification certificate or marksheet, such as Class 10 passing certificate for a Class 11 applicant, or the previous-year marksheet for a renewal applicant.",
