      "Class 10 or equivalent qualifying-examination marksheet/certificate.",
      "Admission proof or institute certificate confirming admission to an eligible AICTE-approved technical diploma programme.",
      "Lateral-entry admission proof, if admitted directly to second year.",
      "Aadhaar/One-Time Registration (OTR) details, as required by the National Scholarship Portal.",
      "Student bank-account details or bank passbook for DBT payment.",
      "For renewal: previous-year passing certificate/marksheet and a letter/certificate from the Head of Institution.",
